  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "campaign I said this election would offer one of the clearest choices in 50 years.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "One major element of that choice is simply this, whether America will continue to champion",
      "start": 4.48,
      "end": 8.86
    },
    {
      "text": "the great driving idea for your future economic growth through individual opportunity, or",
      "start": 8.86,
      "end": 14.44
    },
    {
      "text": "whether our nation will return to the past and stifle that growth.",
      "start": 14.44,
      "end": 17.24
    },
    {
      "text": "We're determined to keep the mighty engine of this nation revved up to build a future",
      "start": 17.92,
      "end": 22.28
    },
    {
      "text": "of lasting economic growth without inflation that reaches every American from the Bronx",
      "start": 22.28,
      "end": 27.28
    },
    {
      "text": "to Birmingham to San Francisco Bay.",
      "start": 27.28,
      "end": 29.24
    },
    {
      "text": "All that we've done and all that we mean to do is to make our free country freer still,",
      "start": 30.24,
      "end": 34.7
    },
    {
      "text": "to bring to each of you greater opportunities to build that stronger future.",
      "start": 35.26,
      "end": 38.82
    },
    {
      "text": "We believe",
      "start": 39.6,
      "end": 39.92
    }
  ]
}